OL,3,GNEWSACarer spent #7,000 using patient's
OL,4,Acredit card
OL,5,
OL,6,FA carer who used her patient's credit
OL,7,Fcard to spend more than #7,000 on
OL,8,Ftakeaways, shopping and gambling has
OL,9,Fbeen given a suspended jail sentence.
OL,11,FSophia Anderson, 39, of Headingley,
OL,12,FLeeds, admitted using the card to make
OL,13,Fpurchases through online food delivery
OL,14,Fservice Deliveroo and online
OL,15,Fmarketplaces eBay and Etsy, as well as
OL,16,Fmaking two payments to gambling
OL,17,Fcompanies.
OL,19,FLeeds Magistrates' Court heard that the
OL,20,Fpatient noticed the transactions on her
OL,21,Fbank statement and her bank traced the
OL,22,Fpayments back to Anderson.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
